<!-- ============================================ 
  Síntesis de la lección (discusión de cierre)
=================================================  -->
<subsubsection xml:id="lec-representarYResolverProblemasDeMultiplicacion-sintesis" component="profesor">
  <shorttitle><custom ref="synthesis-leccion-titulo"/></shorttitle>
  <title><custom ref="synthesis-leccion-titulo"/></title>
  <title component="profesor"><nbsp/>(10 mins)</title>

  <p>[+++++++++++++++]</p>
  <p>Display samples of student work with different representations (drawings of equal groups, tape diagrams, and equations).</p>
<p><q>¿Cuál representación les ayudó más hoy y por qué?</q> (Drawings of equal groups because I could see what was happening in the problem. Diagrams because it helped me understand the problem, but I didn’t have to draw all the dots.)</p>

</subsubsection>



